<<~ ahu slot=`#/head`>>

! realm.offer.signs ~ offer memes toward a house-canon bag

`uris` names the memes and `bag` the house-canon bag; `nexus` names the Nexus whose offer table takes the signed row. An offer grants nothing and moves no canon byte: the promotion stays a hand act at a terminal.

The address stands ''candidate'' until the operator reads the landing's list. The MCP seat runs this act in its own process: the vessel's `call` binds the params against this carrier's live `#/takes` and answers `handler/seat` with the bound params, and the seat runs them (`act(address="lar:///realm.offer.signs", args={…})`).

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/takes`>>

!! takes ~ uris · bag · nexus

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`arg` name=`uris` params=`takes/json needs/required seat/1 as/<lar:uri…> ~ the memes offered`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`bag` params=`takes/word needs/required ~ one bag`>>
<<has entity=`arg` name=`nexus` params=`takes/word ~ the Nexus whose offer table takes the row`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/gate`>>

!! gate ~ seat

Testimony: the door checks; this slot grants nothing.

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`gate` name=`seat` params=`who/seat-or-hand ~ the vessel verbs the seat's handler reaches check the face's cap and the asker's hand themselves; a hand act refuses a seat by its own code`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins`>>

!! skins ~ cli · mcp

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/cli`>>

!!! lares meme offer

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`cli` params=`handler/host spells/[[lares meme offer]] ~ the terminal; the memes ride as <lar:uri…>`>>
```

<<~/ahu>>

<<~ ahu slot=`#/skins/mcp`>>

!!! act lar:///realm.offer.signs

```memetic-wikitext
<<has entity=`skin` name=`mcp` params=`handler/seat spells/[[act lar:///realm.offer.signs]] ~ the seat runs it in its own process`>>
```

